cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository in academic work, please cite the thesis and this software repository."
title: "MultiRank Simulation in International Financial Networks"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Feng"
    given-names: "Xiangtai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fxttamako029-netizen/MultirankSimulation"
url: "https://github.com/fxttamako029-netizen/MultirankSimulation"
abstract: >-
  Research code and data for an Honours thesis studying systemic risk and
  financial contagion in multiplex international banking networks using BIS
  cross-border banking exposures, MultiRank, contagion simulations, credit
  crunch scenarios, heterogeneous buffers, and targeted bailout experiments.
keywords:
  - MultiRank
  - multiplex networks
  - financial networks
  - systemic risk
  - financial contagion
  - BIS
